1. NGRX DEPENDENCIES & STORE CONFIGURATION
- Installed @ngrx packages (@ngrx/store, @ngrx/effects, @ngrx/entity, @ngrx/store-devtools)
- Registered StoreModule.forRoot({ course: courseReducer, enrollment: enrollmentReducer }) in AppModule
- Configured EffectsModule.forRoot([CourseEffects])
- Enabled Redux DevTools: StoreDevtoolsModule.instrument({ maxAge: 25 })

2. COURSE STATE MANAGEMENT (src/app/store/course/)
- Actions: loadCourses, loadCoursesSuccess, loadCoursesFailure with [Course] prefix convention
- Reducer: Pure function handling immutable CourseState transitions
- Selectors: Memoized state queries (selectCourseState, selectAllCourses, selectCoursesLoading, selectCoursesError)
- Effects: CourseEffects executes HTTP API request on loadCourses action and dispatches loadCoursesSuccess/Failure

3. ENROLLMENT STATE & CROSS-SLICE SELECTORS (src/app/store/enrollment/)
- Actions: enrollInCourse, unenrollFromCourse, setEnrolledCourses
- Reducer: Manages enrolledCourseIds array state
- Cross-slice Selector: selectEnrolledCourses combines selectAllCourses and selectEnrolledIds to return joined data stream

4. COMPONENT INTEGRATION
- CourseListComponent:
  * Dispatches loadCourses action in ngOnInit
  * Selects courses$, isLoading$, and error$ from NgRx store
  * Renders using (courses$ | async) pipe
- CourseCardComponent:
  * Selects selectEnrolledIds to derive isEnrolled$
  * Dispatches enrollInCourse and unenrollFromCourse actions on button click
- StudentProfileComponent:
  * Selects cross-slice selectEnrolledCourses selector

